all_candidate_instructions.dataflow_inspector:
List every line of the code that touches the target column: reads it, writes it, filters on it, transforms it, merges it, or passes it along.
Carefully verify the exact 1-based line numbers where the target column name explicitly appears (e.g., df['col'], df.col, in column lists, or in expressions). Ensure line numbers match the exact lines of code and do not include unrelated operations on adjacent columns. Put adjacent lines in one range.

Output only JSON: { "sources": [{ "start_line": int, "end_line": int }, ...] }
